mn38:16.2 starts: These four kinds of nutriment have craving as
mn38:16.3 starts: And this craving has what as its source…?
mn38:16.4 starts: Craving has feeling as its source…And this
mn38:16.5 starts: And this feeling has what as its source…?
mn38:16.6 starts: Feeling has contact as its source…And this
mn38:16.7 starts: And this contact has what as its source…?
mn38:16.8 starts: Contact has the sixfold base as its source…And
mn38:16.9 starts: And this sixfold base has what as its source…?
mn38:16.10 starts: The sixfold base has mentality-materiality as its source…And
mn38:16.11 starts: And this mentality-materiality has what as its source…?
